{"id":"255364c0a7fc9610","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-lightface.md","title":"Lightface Hierarchy","display":"df-lightface — Lightface Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lightface","aliases":["58-df-lightface"],"display":"df-lightface — Lightface Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lightface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lightface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lightface — Lightface Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"128279b1439d2b71\" href=\"?note=128279b1439d2b71\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>（Baire 空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,T\\in V\">\\(A,B,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}:\\mathcal N^2\\to\\mathcal N\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}:\\mathcal N^2\\to\\mathcal N\\)</span> 是固定的有效配对同胚，例如按偶、奇坐标交错两个 Baire 实数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputableTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputableTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 上的可计算树谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"128279b1439d2b71\" href=\"?note=128279b1439d2b71\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\pi_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span> 是本原子定义的、经上述配对识别后的 Baire 投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{\\complement_{\\mathcal N}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal N\\setminus A\">\\(A^{\\complement_{\\mathcal N}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal N\\setminus A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n,\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n,\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n\\)</span>（允许实参数的 boldface 类，仅用于区分）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_n,\\Pi^1_n,\\Delta^1_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\Sigma^1_n,\\Pi^1_n,\\Delta^1_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N)\\)</span>（此处递归定义的 lightface 射影点类）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\pi_{\\mathcal N}(B)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\mathcal N:\\exists y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}\\in B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\pi_{\\mathcal N}(B)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in\\mathcal N:\\exists y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}\\in B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^1_1\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nA\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\n\\exists T\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputableTree}_S(T)\n\\land\nA=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in\\mathcal N:\n\\exists y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}\\upharpoonright m\\in T\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one}\\vdash\n\\Sigma^1_1\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nA\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\n\\exists T\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputableTree}_S(T)\n\\land\nA=\n\\left\\{\nx\\in\\mathcal N:\n\\exists y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal N}\\upharpoonright m\\in T\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}pi}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Pi^1_n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\nA^{\\complement_{\\mathcal N}}\\in\\Sigma^1_n\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}pi}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Pi^1_n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\nA^{\\complement_{\\mathcal N}}\\in\\Sigma^1_n\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma^1_{n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\n\\exists B\\in\\Pi^1_n\\;(A=\\pi_{\\mathcal N}(B))\\}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma^1_{n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathcal N:\n\\exists B\\in\\Pi^1_n\\;(A=\\pi_{\\mathcal N}(B))\\}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}delta}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\Delta^1_n\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_n\\cap\\Pi^1_n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lightface\\text{-}delta}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\bigl(\\Delta^1_n\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_n\\cap\\Pi^1_n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lightface 层级要求定义具有有效代码且不使用实参数；自然数参数通常允许。</li>\n<li>Boldface <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n\\)</span> 允许实参数，不能与 lightface 记号混用。</li>\n<li>原定义从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_{n-1}\">\\(\\Pi^1_{n-1}\\)</span> 递归却没有给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 基阶，也没有定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_n\">\\(\\Pi^1_n\\)</span>，现已补全。</li>\n<li>基阶现在用可计算树的投影刻画，因而“有效且无实参数”由已有可计算树谓词见证，而不是留给未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>配对同胚把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N^2\">\\(\\mathcal N^2\\)</span> 有效识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal N\\)</span>，使后继投影的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Pi^1_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N)\">\\(B\\in\\Pi^1_n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N)\\)</span> 类型一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion2-computable-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"128279b1439d2b71","an